WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.520
It was a small miracle.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.980
Our prayers reached the distant sky.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:15.570
Our tears turned to light
and became a rainbow.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.530
The long night finally came to an end.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.000
When you say "goodbye"
as you set off on a journey,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.880
it's not a word of farewell,
but of new beginnings.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:36.430
The final episode of Mahou Shoujo
Lyrical Nanoha A's will now begin.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:32.290
As I thought... the damage was extensive
enough to reach the vital parts.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:35.420
The defense program has been stopped,

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:38.420
but the underlying structure
is still incredibly corrupted.

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:42.890
I... the Tome of the Night Sky itself...

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:49.600
will soon generate a new defense program,
and will probably go out of control again.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.060
As I thought...

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.230
Can't you repair it?

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:55.690
It's impossible.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.610
Even though the administrator
program lies within me...

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:02.740
the information in the actual
tome itself has been erased.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:07.250
So you can't repair it because you don't
know the original state of the data?

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.370
Correct.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.580
Will Master Hayate be all right?

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.460
That's not a problem.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:20.930
I am no longer devouring her, and her Linker
Core is operating within normal parameters.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:25.180
Even her disabled legs will
heal naturally, given time.

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:26.390
I see...

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:30.480
Then... I guess we're ready...

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.440
Yes. I no longer have any regrets.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.730
Now that the defense
program no longer exists...

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.900
then the complete destruction of the
Tome of the Night Sky should be easy.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.950
If it's gone,
it'll never go berserk again.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.450
Though in exchange, we'll be gone with it.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.990
I'm sorry, Vita.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.080
Why are you apologizing?

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.870
I don't mind, really...

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:57.840
Everyone knew all along that there
was a chance this could happen...

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.630
No, that's not quite right.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.180
You four will remain.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:06.010
The only one to go... will be me.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.770
Destroy the Tome of the Night Sky?

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:19.650
Why?! Didn't we already
destroy its defense program?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.280
The Book of Darkness...

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.910
I mean, the Tome of the Night Sky's
administrator program suggested it.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.950
You mean the administrator program
that Nanoha and everyone fought?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:29.910
Yes.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.870
The defense program was
successfully destroyed, but...

00:04:32.870 --> 00:04:37.130
it looks like the Tome of the Night Sky
will quickly recompile its programs.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:42.170
There's a good chance that it'll start
devouring Hayate-chan instantly this time...

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:46.840
and as long as it still exists,
the danger will never go away.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:51.850
That's why the Tome itself
asked to be destroyed now,

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.810
while there's no defense program.

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:55.850
No way...

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.520
But Signum and the other knights will...

00:04:58.520 --> 00:04:59.230
No.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.780
We will remain.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.860
Signum...

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.360
It seems when the defense
program was defeated,

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:09.240
our guardian knight
programs were also released.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:15.120
Reinforce said she had a request for you all.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.790
A request?

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:26.630
Hayate, your happiness is
our greatest happiness.

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:30.350
Which is why Reinforce
said she'd go with a smile.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:40.610
Even if it's only in your dreams,
watch over her...

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.920
Ah... you came.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.630
Reinforce... -san.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.930
So, you'll call me by that name now.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.470
Yes...

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:16.520
Do you really want us to be the ones
to send you back into the sky?

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.810
I want to ask this of you
because of what you did.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:26.190
Thanks to you, I was able to
hear Master Hayate's words.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:28.860
You stopped me before I ended up
corroding her body and killing her...

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.320
and even the knights can live on.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.870
I'm grateful.

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:38.540
So in the end... I want you two
to be the ones to send me off.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:42.590
Do you really have to leave
Hayate-chan like this?

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.590
I don't want to make Master Hayate sad.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.380
Reinforce...

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:53.800
But that's still just too sad!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.560
One day, you will surely understand.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.100
To meet someone for whom
your love is deeper than the sea,

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:05.230
and whose happiness you wish to protect.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.620
Shall we get started, then?

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:21.620
These will be the Tome of the
Night Sky's final moments.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:39.930
Reinforce...?

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.620
Ready to set.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.830
Stand by.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:12.050
Yes... I was in your care, too,
if only for a short while.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.300
Don't worry.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.260
Take a good journey.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.600
I shall.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.560
Reinforce!

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.520
Everyone!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:29.440
Hayate-chan.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:29.860
Hayate!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.070
Don't move!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.200
Please don't move.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.820
The ritual would end.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.820
No! Stop!

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.330
Reinforce, stop!

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.500
You don't have to destroy yourself!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.540
I'll suppress it!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.040
It'll be fine!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.540
You don't have to do this!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.300
Master Hayate... it's fine.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:59.560
No, it's not!
It's not fine at all!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:03.560
I've lived for quite a long time...

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:10.020
but at the very end, I received a
beautiful name and heart from you.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.490
The knights will also remain by your side.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:15.530
There is nothing to worry about.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.030
I'm not worried or anythi–

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:20.530
So please, I will depart smiling.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:25.330
I hate girls who won't listen!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.040
I'm your master!
Listen to me!

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.590
I'll definitely do something about it!

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:33.840
I won't let you go out of control!
I promised you that, didn't I?!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.430
You've already kept that
promise magnificently.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.930
Reinforce!

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:48.520
The duty of the Tome is to protect
and eliminate dangers to her master.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:54.440
Please, let me choose the most
efficient way of protecting you.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:10:00.830
But... you've been sad for so long...

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:07.000
and you were finally... finally... saved!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:14.760
My will shall live on in the
knights and your magic.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:19.260
I will always be at your side.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:23.760
That's not the same!
It's not the same, Reinforce!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:27.100
It's no good to throw a fit.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.980
Please understand, my master.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.020
Reinforce!

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:36.150
Why...?

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.780
We were supposed to be...

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:44.660
We were supposed to be
happy from now on!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.880
It is all right.

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:56.170
Right now, I am the happiest
magical tome there is.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.170
Reinforce...

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:06.020
Master Hayate, I have one request.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:12.690
When I vanish, I will change into a small,
powerless fragment of my current self.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:17.690
If it is all right with you, do not give
my name to that small fragment...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:24.950
but to the new vessel that
will hold your magic in the future.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:29.910
"The blessed wind, Reinforce."

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.630
My soul will surely dwell within it.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.210
Reinforce...

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.880
Yes, my master.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.900
Master Hayate...

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.900
Guardian knights...

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.530
and you young heroines...

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.410
Thank you...

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.410
and... goodbye.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:43.860
Hayate-chan...

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:44.950
Hayate.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.330
Is that so?

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.920
Okay.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.250
Thanks for letting me know.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:59.920
Rest up at home today, okay?

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:02.760
I'll be back tomorrow.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:03.840
Okay.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.050
Was that Fate-chan?

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.050
Yes.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:09.560
She just confirmed the passing
of the Tome of the Night Sky.

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.560
I see...

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:18.020
As for Admiral Graham, it looks like
he's settled things by resigning.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:20.020
Seems he'll be returning to his homeland.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:24.110
Well, he only did some cracking
and hindered an investigation.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.110
That's about it, after all...

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.530
I wonder what'll happen
to Hayate-san, though...

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.540
He said he'd continue to
support her like before.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.620
And he said that once she's
old enough to live on her own,

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.960
he'd probably tell her the truth.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.040
I see.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.920
Now you can finally report what
happened to your late husband, huh?

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.880
When are you going?

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:47.550
Next week, with Chrono and Fate-san.
It'll just be the three of us.

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.430
What do you plan on telling him?

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:53.560
I wonder... probably the same as usual.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:58.350
"Things here are as crazy as ever,
but we're all doing great."

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:00.980
I see.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.710
I guess that ends the case...

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.170
Yeah.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.210
It's a little lonely, though.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:32.810
Chrono told me that cases regarding
Lost Logia are always like this.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:37.310
A chain of sad events is always
guided by the light of incredible power.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:39.560
Yeah.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:43.730
I think I'm going to continue
working for the Bureau.

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:46.400
I want to become a full-time Enforcer...

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.320
so I can at least try to
stop events like this...

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:53.200
or the one that
happened with my mother.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:56.200
What about you, Nanoha?

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.460
Have you given it any thought?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.170
About what you'll do now...

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:04.800
I don't think I could become an Enforcer,

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:08.550
but I'm probably headed in
the same direction as you.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:12.050
I want to convey my way of magic to others.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:33.740
Yuuno-kun... even though you came back,
we didn't get to see each other much.

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.330
I spent all of my time investigating, after all.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.250
Yuuno-kun, what do you plan on doing now?

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:45.630
Well... I was asked by the Bureau to
become the Infinity Library's Chief Librarian...

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:48.550
I think they have a dorm
for me at the Main Office,

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:53.140
and I can also continue my archaeological
work, so I might go with that.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:57.760
The main office is way closer to here than
Midchilda, so I guess I'm happy about that.

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:58.770
Really?

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.770
Yeah!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.480
Well, I'll take my leave here.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:09.190
They said I can stay aboard the Arthra
until my position's been confirmed.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.240
I see.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.030
Yeah.

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:15.160
Yuuno-kun, if you have some free
time on or around New Year's,

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.450
let's hang out together, okay?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:20.790
There's a ton of stuff I want
to talk to you about!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.000
Sure.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:32.590
<i>Do you have some time tomorrow?</i>

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:36.640
<i>I'm planning to go visit Hayate-chan
with Arisa-chan in the morning,</i>

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:41.100
<i>and hold a Christmas party at my house afterwards.</i>

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.060
<i>I've also invited Fate-chan.</i>

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:45.980
<i>I'd be glad if you could make it, too.</i>

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:52.240
I guess we'll have to explain everything
that's happened to them, too...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.700
So Hayate's back in the hospital.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:01.700
Come to think of it, she was out running around
when she was supposed to be resting in bed.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.670
Good morning!

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:08.540
Good morning, Nanoha-chan, Fate-chan!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.500
Huh?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.170
What's wrong?
Have you already been discharged?

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:15.180
No, unfortunately.
I'll be here for a little while longer.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.390
I see...

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:18.970
But I'm feeling great.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:23.520
I told Suzuka-chan not to visit here, since
I'll be heading straight over to the party!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.180
I see.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.650
So much happened yesterday, but...

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:29.650
thank you for everything,
from the beginning to the very end.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:30.650
Not at all.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:31.570
Don't worry about it.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:35.320
Is that Reinforce?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.780
Yeah.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:42.330
She's gone to sleep,
but we'll be together from now on.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:46.870
I'm also thinking of installing
a new Device inside this.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.710
Hayate, you're still going to be a mage?

00:17:51.090 --> 00:17:53.710
It's the power she gave me...

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.130
And besides, thanks to this case,

00:17:56.130 --> 00:18:01.100
me and the knights are all
probationary officers for the Bureau.

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.220
Really?

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.220
Pretty much.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:08.980
We'll be following up on some of their
business to make up for our crimes.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:11.980
Enforcer Chrono arranged all this for us.

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:14.780
Our term is pretty long...

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:19.910
but this was probably the only way we
could always stay near Hayate-chan.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.490
I see.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:26.410
And I'll be treated as a temporary officer,
so I guess that'll make me your junior, huh?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:32.420
Hayate-chan!
You'd better come back today!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.670
Promise me!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.670
Yes! I promise!

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:35.890
So it was a real mess here
last night and this morning?

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.430
You're such a good patient.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:39.190
Yeah. She spent the night away without
permission, so they got in big trouble.

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:42.430
Okay, just make sure not
to overexert yourself.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.600
Yes, I'll be sure not to.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:44.600
She's a scary doctor...

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.640
So let's do a pinky promise.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:46.520
But...

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:49.270
She's a very good one.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:51.270
Sure looks like it.

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:52.020
Thank you very much.

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:52.650
Be careful!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:53.270
Okay!

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:57.990
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:58.990
Not at all!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.200
Testarossa.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.950
Yes, Signum?

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:08.660
The match we put off... one day,
I'll definitely settle it with you.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:11.120
Yes, fair and square.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.630
Many, many times.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.560
Morning, Kyouya-chan.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:28.560
"Morning"?
It's already past noon!

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.600
Yeah...

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.810
What're you looking at?

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:34.520
A letter from Nanoha.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.820
What's this now?

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:39.490
"Dear Mom, Dad, Onii-chan, Onee-chan..."

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:42.070
"Later tonight, I have something
important to talk to you about."

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:45.530
"Lindy-san and Fate-chan
will also be coming...

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:49.040
so please listen to what we
have to say before dinner."

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.580
"Nanoha."

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.330
Something important to talk to us about?

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.460
I wonder what this important talk is?

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.630
Who knows?

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:01.010
Maybe something about what
she wants to do with her future?

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:06.390
Nanoha and Fate said they should
be arriving any minute now.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:11.350
They also have something they want to
get out into the open with Hayate, too.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.390
Okay.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:17.070
I wonder if Hayate was
there last night, too...

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.110
Who knows?

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:23.860
Well, if they want to keep it
a secret, that's fine with me.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:26.870
But if they decide they want to tell us,
then let's listen to what they have to say.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:33.250
I'd be happy if she tells us everything
starting from how she met Fate-chan.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:40.840
If they tell us everything, I feel like we'll
become even better friends than ever before.

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:43.340
Yeah. You're right.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.550
I see. So you'll be working
here at the main office, too?

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.350
Yeah.

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:50.350
It seems that Nanoha will also
continue as a temporary employee...

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:53.350
so it's like everyone will
be working here, huh?

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.690
It's nice to see.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:59.360
There's talk of her applying
to be a combat instructor, too...

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:05.740
I'm also counting on you
a little as the Chief Librarian.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.370
Thank you...

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:13.910
Actually, when you go outside in this
form, you don't really look dangerous...

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.000
And you get good mileage like this,
so it's pretty convenient.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.210
Really?!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:56.460
And so, the Book of Darkness case ended.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:22:02.840
After passing through so many
new encounters and farewells...

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:05.340
new days will surely begin for us.

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:27.780
Shamal, could you send

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:31.030
the package to Graham-ojisan for me?

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:32.740
Yes. Leave it to me!

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:34.950
Signum, I'll meet up with you later.

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:36.290
Yes. I shall see you this afternoon.

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:38.290
Alright!

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.790
Hayate, take care!

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:45.300
I'm off!

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:57.770
There we go!

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:00.940
Fate.

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:02.940
Here's your lunch.

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:05.440
Thank you...

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:07.150
Mom.

00:23:19.620 --> 00:23:20.920
Today's the first time in a while

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.330
that everyone's gotten together, huh?

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.090
Yeah.

00:23:24.090 --> 00:23:27.590
I think the first time since you became Captain.

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:30.380
Yeah, should be a fairly peaceful mission.

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:32.300
I guess it'll be like a little reunion party.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.010
You said it.

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:36.010
Can you make it too, Yuuno?

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:37.930
Yeah. I should be there right on time.

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:39.600
Come to think of it, Yuuno-kun...

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:41.940
any progress between you and Nanoha-chan?

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:43.440
Ah... um...

00:23:43.440 --> 00:23:45.520
We meet now and then,

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:47.530
but there hasn't been any "progress," really...

00:23:47.530 --> 00:23:48.530
Oh, ho?

00:23:48.530 --> 00:23:51.150
Amy, you're still on the clock. Back to work.

00:23:51.150 --> 00:23:52.160
Yes, sir!

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:00.290
Nanoha!

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:01.250
Nanoha-chan!

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:04.960
Arisa-chan! Suzuka-chan!

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:08.800
Morning.

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:10.420
Good morning.

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:11.630
Do you have work again today?

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:12.630
Yup.

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:15.640
We're having a reunion with everyone today.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.600
I'll be leaving just after noon,

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:19.350
so please take care of notes for me!

00:24:19.350 --> 00:24:20.230
Sure thing!

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:22.600
I'll take some easy-to-copy notes for you!

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:24.730
Thanks a lot!

00:24:25.860 --> 00:24:27.860
Good morning!

00:24:27.860 --> 00:24:29.070
Morning!

00:24:29.070 --> 00:24:30.610
I hear everyone's meeting up today?

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:31.490
Yeah.

00:24:31.490 --> 00:24:33.610
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:24:57.350 --> 00:24:59.850
<i>The bonds that first formed that day</i>

00:24:59.850 --> 00:25:02.270
<i>are still firmly tied together even now.</i>

00:25:03.100 --> 00:25:05.230
Raising Heart!

00:25:05.230 --> 00:25:07.230
Yes, my master.

00:25:07.650 --> 00:25:08.980
Bardiche.

00:25:08.980 --> 00:25:10.230
Yes, sir.

00:25:10.360 --> 00:25:11.860
Reinforce.

00:25:13.860 --> 00:25:16.410
Yes, Meister Hayate.

00:25:23.290 --> 00:25:24.460
Stand by, Ready.

00:25:25.170 --> 00:25:27.500
Set up!
